  "subject": "a woman who is woken at exactly 4:17 every night by a calf cramp and has to stand barefoot on the cold kitchen tiles of her tiny flat, flexing her toes and counting the trucks on the flyover until the knot lets go",
  "caption": "Cantonese darkwave, 1980s coldwave style. Pulsing analogue bass sequence in eighths, gated drum machine with snappy reverb snare, chorus-drenched clean electric guitar arpeggios, icy sustained synth pad. Dark reverb-heavy mix, wide cold synths. Female mezzo, low and steady, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 112 BPM, D minor. Cold, wry and sleepless. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no bright pop hooks, no EDM drops.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n又係凌晨四點十七\n我隻腳突然扯筋\n成條小腿硬過石頭\n痛到我坐直身\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我赤腳行出廚房\n踩住凍冰冰階磚\n\n[Chorus]\n四點十七 腳趾向上\n天橋有架貨車經過\n我數一架 再數一架\n等條筋自己鬆開\n\n[Verse]\n醫生叫我食多啲香蕉\n瞓前飲多杯水\n我買咗一梳擺喺床邊\n佢照樣準時嚟\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n雪櫃嗡嗡咁響\n得佢陪我企喺度\n\n[Chorus]\n四點十七 腳趾向上\n天橋有架的士經過\n我數一架 再數一架\n窗外仲未有光\n\n[Verse]\n有晚我諗住唔瞓\n坐喺度等佢嚟\n四點十七我望住鐘\n佢竟然唔嚟\n\n[Bridge]\n我等到五點半\n天開始變灰\n我先至喺梳化瞓著\n\n[Chorus]\n四點十七 腳趾向上\n今晚我又企返喺度\n我數一架 再數一架\n同條筋講聲早晨\n\n[Outro]\n四點十七\n聽晚見",
